
### Add a job application
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobTitle": "Java Developer",
  "company": "Accenture",
  "location": "Bangalore",
  "jobUrl": "https://www.accenture.com",
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "appliedDate": "2026-11-09",
  "notes": "Applied for Java Developer role"
}

### Get all job applications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications

### Delete duplicate 2
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/2

### Delete duplicate 3
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/3

### Delete duplicate 4
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/4

### Delete duplicate 5
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/5
